DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uuaarrkk driver supports Arkmicro Technologies ARK3116 based serial
     adapters.

     The following devices should work with the uuaarrkk driver:

           HL USB-RS232
           HugePine USB-UART
           KQ-U8A Data Cable
           Skymaster USB to RS232

